cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Free-Body Statics for Reinforcement Section Loss in Concrete Discontinuity Regions"
abstract: >-
  Code and generated reference fields for recovering the remaining tie
  reinforcement section of a deteriorating concrete discontinuity region from
  measured strain. The identifying condition is affine in the section loss, so
  the recovery is a root rather than the minimizer of an objective. Published
  test data are cited rather than redistributed.
